" لاحقاً، مو سجلاً طبياً رسمياً."
msgstr ""
"A free note you can optionally link to a barn or an animal number — it "
"becomes a reference for the assistant later, not an official medical "
"record."

#: app/templates/assistant/chat.html:111
msgid ""
"أي ملاحظة ميدانية حقيقية تكتبها هنا (سلوك حظيرة، سبب مشكلة تكرّرت، حل "
"جرّبته...) تصير خبرة يقدر المساعد الذكي يرجع لها مستقبلاً عند سؤال مشابه."
" ما تُستخدم كقاعدة طبية ثابتة — مجرد سياق مرجعي."
msgstr ""
"Any real field note you write here (barn behavior, a recurring problem's "
"cause, a solution you tried...) becomes experience the smart assistant "
"can recall for a similar question later. It is never used as a fixed "
"medical rule — just reference context."

#: app/templates/assistant/chat.html:115
