"ولادة/وزن/توزيع مهمة)، وينتظر اعتمادك قبل أي تنفيذ."
msgstr ""
"Type a free sentence about something that actually happened — the "
"assistant suggests a matching action (recording a birth/weight/assigning "
"a task), and waits for your approval before doing anything."

