"بالحظيرة."
msgstr ""
"Same idea as \"Send text\" — but you record your voice instead of typing,"
" handy when your hands are busy in the barn."

#: app/templates/assistant/chat.html:176
msgid ""
"اكتب أو سجّل صوتياً حدثاً صار فعلاً بالمزرعة (مثال: \"سجلت ولادة اليوم "
"لشاة رقم 405\") — المساعد يقترح مسودة، وما ينفَّذ أي شي بقاعدة البيانات "
"إلا بعد ما تضغط \"اعتماد\" بنفسك."
msgstr ""
"Write or record an event that actually happened on the farm (example: \"I"
" recorded a birth today for ewe number 405\") — the assistant proposes a "
"draft, and nothing is written to the database until you press \"Approve\""
" yourself."

#: app/templates/assistant/chat.html:180
