"علّمتها \"مصروف غير مباشر\" عند الإدخال) تدخل هنا تلقائياً ضمن "
"\"المصروف\" — نفس التوزيع بالتساوي على القطيع."
msgstr ""
"Cost = purchases + expenses per month (excluding debt and sales), divided"
" by the actual head count for that specific month (calculated from each "
"animal's real entry/exit date — not the current count). Indirect expenses"
" (rent/maintenance/salaries — marked \"indirect expense\" on entry) are "
"automatically included here under \"expense\" — same even split across "
"the herd."

